  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Safety (Phases 4–5)",
      "items": [
        "User messages are redacted in the API before the agent runs; PIIMiddleware redacts tool results and replies, and the SSE stream is redacted too",
        "web_search pauses for approval when the query has sensitive terms or an order number",
        "New messages to a paused thread get 409"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Accounts and limits (Phase 8)",
      "items": [
        "Register and log in at /auth (argon2id passwords); every request needs an HS256 JWT whose account still exists",
        "Per-user and per-IP moving-window limits in Redis, tighter for log-in; over a limit is 429 with Retry-After",
        "A daily token budget per user, counted after each model call; checked before a run starts. Redis down lets requests through",
        "Optional own OpenAI-compatible URL and key, checked at login and kept in the UI session; that user's runs use it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Memory (Phases 3 and 6)",
      "items": [
        "Short-term: each thread's checkpoints; past CONTEXT_MAX_TOKENS (10k) older turns are summarized after the reply, so the user never waits",
        "Long-term pushes: turns a summary folds away, threads idle for 30 min (a loop in the API), the Remember this button on a reply, or the remember tool",
        "MemoryWriter (gpt-5-mini) extracts the user's facts and decides add / update / delete against the 5 closest memories; a per-thread cursor stops double pushes",
        "Placeholders and claims of status or discounts are never stored; temporary facts expire through the store's TTL sweeper",
        "Recall searches every turn and adds memories the thread hasn't seen; the prompt only changes when one turns up, so the prompt cache keeps working",
        "One push per user at a time across processes (Postgres advisory lock), at most MEMORY_WRITE_CONCURRENCY per process"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Evals (Phase 7)",
      "items": [
        "make eval runs the agent on 44 golden questions and scores retrieval, routing, faithfulness, citations and correctness, plus labelled PII and approval-policy sets",
        "gpt-4.1 judges through DeepEval; a judged metric gates only at 90% agreement with labelled answers (citations 98%, faithfulness 91%, correctness 90%)",
        "CI gets no model credentials: it reruns the code-only suites, rejects a stale report.json, and blocks a drop below main's scores"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Reliability",
      "items": [
        "ModelCallLimitMiddleware ends a run after MAX_MODEL_CALLS",
        "Both search tools retry once, then give the model an error to relay",
        "A failed summary keeps the full history; a memory push that doesn't finish leaves its thread's cursor, so it runs again later (unless the content filter rejected it)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Optional",
      "items": [
        "Langfuse tracing when LANGFUSE keys are set",
        "MEMORY_ENABLED, PII_ENABLED, HITL_ENABLED and WEB_SEARCH_ENABLED switch features off",
        "Empty RERANKER_MODEL disables reranking"
      ]
    }
  ]
}